# workbooks-system — concepts

Read this when you need a precise mental model of a platform primitive — workbook, runtime, toolkit, workflow, the Dock, bundle⇄unbundle, or HOST vs LOADED — before acting on it. This is the "what things are" skill; the "how to do it" skills are `authoring`, `toolkits`, `workflows`.

app :workbooks_system__concepts do
  title       "workbooks-system — concepts"
  description "Read this when you need a precise mental model of a platform primitive — workbook, runtime, toolkit, workflow, the Dock, bundle⇄unbundle, or HOST vs LOADED — before acting on it."
